{"seq":4,"slug":"interrupt-and-timer","title":"中断与定时器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/embedded-fundamentals/interrupt-and-timer","wordCount":930,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"中断与定时器\">中断与定时器</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>中断（Interrupt）和定时器（Timer）是嵌入式系统实现实时响应的两大核心机制。中断使 MCU 能够在外部事件发生时立即暂停当前任务并执行处理程序，定时器则提供精确的时间基准——从微秒级的 PWM 波形生成到毫秒级的系统心跳。两者的协同工作构成了嵌入式实时控制的基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[中断源] --&gt; B[NVIC 中断控制器]&#10;    B --&gt; C{优先级仲裁}&#10;    C --&gt;|最高优先级| D[保存上下文]&#10;    D --&gt; E[执行 ISR]&#10;    E --&gt; F[恢复上下文]&#10;    F --&gt; G[返回主程序]&#10;    H[定时器] --&gt; I[计数器]&#10;    I --&gt; J[比较匹配]&#10;    J --&gt; K[中断/DMA/PWM]&#10;    I --&gt; L[溢出]&#10;    L --&gt; K\">graph TD\n    A[中断源] --&gt; B[NVIC 中断控制器]\n    B --&gt; C{优先级仲裁}\n    C --&gt;|最高优先级| D[保存上下文]\n    D --&gt; E[执行 ISR]\n    E --&gt; F[恢复上下文]\n    F --&gt; G[返回主程序]\n    H[定时器] --&gt; I[计数器]\n    I --&gt; J[比较匹配]\n    J --&gt; K[中断/DMA/PWM]\n    I --&gt; L[溢出]\n    L --&gt; K</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中断类型</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Reset</td>\n<td>系统复位</td>\n<td>最高（-3）</td>\n<td>系统启动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NMI</td>\n<td>不可屏蔽</td>\n<td>-2</td>\n<td>时钟安全、看门狗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HardFault</td>\n<td>CPU 异常</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n<td>错误处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SysTick</td>\n<td>系统定时器</td>\n<td>可配置</td>\n<td>RTOS 时基</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外设中断</td>\n<td>GPIO/UART/TIM 等</td>\n<td>可配置</td>\n<td>业务逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"中断优先级与嵌套\">中断优先级与嵌套</h2><p>ARM Cortex-M 的 NVIC 支持可编程优先级和中断嵌套。优先级分为抢占优先级（Preemption Priority）和子优先级（Sub-Priority）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 优先级分组配置（STM32 使用 4 位优先级）&#10;// Group 0: 0 位抢占 / 4 位子优先级&#10;// Group 1: 1 位抢占 / 3 位子优先级&#10;// Group 2: 2 位抢占 / 2 位子优先级（FreeRTOS 推荐）&#10;// Group 3: 3 位抢占 / 1 位子优先级&#10;// Group 4: 4 位抢占 / 0 位子优先级&#10;&#10;HAL_NVIC_SetPriorityGrouping(NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_2);&#10;&#10;// 抢占优先级不同 → 高优先级可以打断低优先级（嵌套）&#10;// 抢占优先级相同 → 比较子优先级，不能嵌套，按子优先级顺序执行&#10;HAL_NVIC_SetPriority(USART1_IRQn, 1, 0);  // 抢占1, 子优先级0&#10;HAL_NVIC_SetPriority(TIM2_IRQn, 0, 0);    // 抢占0 → 可打断 USART1&#10;&#10;HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ(USART1_IRQn);&#10;HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ(TIM2_IRQn);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 优先级分组配置（STM32 使用 4 位优先级）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Group 0: 0 位抢占 / 4 位子优先级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Group 1: 1 位抢占 / 3 位子优先级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Group 2: 2 位抢占 / 2 位子优先级（FreeRTOS 推荐）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Group 3: 3 位抢占 / 1 位子优先级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Group 4: 4 位抢占 / 0 位子优先级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HAL_NVIC_SetPriorityGrouping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 抢占优先级不同 → 高优先级可以打断低优先级（嵌套）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 抢占优先级相同 → 比较子优先级，不能嵌套，按子优先级顺序执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HAL_NVIC_SetPriority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(USART1_IRQn, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 抢占1, 子优先级0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HAL_NVIC_SetPriority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(TIM2_IRQn, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 抢占0 → 可打断 USART1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(USART1_IRQn);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(TIM2_IRQn);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>中断延迟分析</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>延迟成分</th>\n<th>Cortex-M3/M4</th>\n<th>Cortex-M0</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>入栈</td>\n<td>12 周期</td>\n<td>16 周期</td>\n<td>自动保存 R0-R3, R12, LR, PC, xPSR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>获取向量</td>\n<td>与入栈并行</td>\n<td>额外延迟</td>\n<td>从向量表读取 ISR 地址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾链</td>\n<td>6 周期</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>连续中断无需出栈再入栈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总延迟</td>\n<td>12 周期</td>\n<td>16+ 周期</td>\n<td>从中断请求到 ISR 第一条指令</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"定时器工作模式\">定时器工作模式</h2><p>STM32 的定时器功能极其丰富，从基本计数到高级 PWM，覆盖了绝大多数实时控制需求：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 基本定时器：周期性中断&#10;TIM_HandleTypeDef htim6;&#10;htim6.Instance = TIM6;&#10;htim6.Init.Prescaler = 8400 - 1;       // 84MHz / 8400 = 10KHz&#10;htim6.Init.Period = 10000 - 1;          // 10KHz / 10000 = 1Hz&#10;htim6.Init.CounterMode = TIM_COUNTERMODE_UP;&#10;HAL_TIM_Base_Init(&amp;htim6);&#10;HAL_TIM_Base_Start_IT(&amp;htim6);&#10;&#10;void TIM6_DAC_IRQHandler(void) {&#10;    HAL_TIM_IRQHandler(&amp;htim6);&#10;}&#10;&#10;void HAL_TIM_PeriodElapsedCallback(TIM_HandleTypeDef *htim) {&#10;    if (htim-&gt;Instance == TIM6) {&#10;        toggle_led();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 基本定时器：周期性中断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TIM_HandleTypeDef htim6;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">htim6.Instance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TIM6;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">htim6.Init.Prescaler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8400</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // 84MHz / 8400 = 10KHz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">htim6.Init.Period </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          // 10KHz / 10000 = 1Hz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">htim6.Init.CounterMode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TIM_COUNTERMODE_UP;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HAL_TIM_Base_Init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">htim6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HAL_TIM_Base_Start_IT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">htim6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TIM6_DAC_IRQHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    HAL_TIM_IRQHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">htim6);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HAL_TIM_PeriodElapsedCallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(TIM_HandleTypeDef </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">htim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (htim->Instance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TIM6) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        toggle_led</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>PWM 输出</strong>——用于电机控制、LED 调光、伺服驱动：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// TIM3 CH1 输出 1KHz PWM，占空比 50%&#10;TIM_OC_InitTypeDef sConfigOC = {0};&#10;htim3.Instance = TIM3;&#10;htim3.Init.Prescaler = 84 - 1;         // 84MHz / 84 = 1MHz&#10;htim3.Init.Period = 1000 - 1;           // 1MHz / 1000 = 1KHz&#10;HAL_TIM_PWM_Init(&amp;htim3);&#10;&#10;sConfigOC.OCMode = TIM_OCMODE_PWM1;&#10;sConfigOC.Pulse = 500;                   // 500/1000 = 50% 占空比&#10;sConfigOC.OCPolarity = TIM_OCPOLARITY_HIGH;&#10;HAL_TIM_PWM_ConfigChannel(&amp;htim3, &amp;sConfigOC, TIM_CHANNEL_1);&#10;HAL_TIM_PWM_Start(&amp;htim3, TIM_CHANNEL_1);&#10;&#10;// 动态调节占空比&#10;__HAL_TIM_SET_COMPARE(&amp;htim3, TIM_CHANNEL_1, new_duty);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// TIM3 CH1 输出 1KHz PWM，占空比 50%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TIM_OC_InitTypeDef sConfigOC </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark: